# Vendored copy of https://github.com/float3.keys
#
# These used to be a flake input pointing at the live GitHub URL. That URL is
# mutable, so its narHash changed whenever a key was added or removed on the
# account, which invalidated flake.lock and broke every CI run. Public SSH keys
# are not secret, so they live in-tree and are updated deliberately.
